  // ── Phase 2 §d — per-artifact approval + sharing (2026-08) ─────────────────
  /// MeetingNoteStatus: 'draft' (default; captured, never explicitly approved)
  /// | 'edited' (was approved, then a later edit reset it — needs
  /// re-approval) | 'approved' (explicit POST .../notes/:noteId/approve).
